   "based_on": "DQSBUF",
   "differences": "DQSBUF plus the bank's VREF generator (IVREF_CORE): extra input bus IVREFI[6:0] (the LVSTL inputs' internal reference level, 0-127) and parameter LPDDR4_BL16_EN, which plain DQSBUF does not have (LSE: 'module DQSBUF does not have a parameter named LPDDR4_BL16_EN'). Every other parameter sets the same DQSBUF bits as on DQSBUF. Map places at most one per bank, and requires the group's DQS pad to be a differential LVSTL type (LVSTLD_I / LVSTLD_II). Using it sets BANK<n>.IVREF.ON in the bank reference tile, and Radiant gives the bank's LVSTL inputs VREF_LVSTL.VREF_INT. See fuzzers/LFCPNX/037-ivref and 157-dqsbuf-ivref.",
   "bank_settings": [
    "BANK<n>.IVREF.ON"
   ]
  },
